      <title>游戏《霍格沃茨之遗》</title>
      <link>https://rosefinch-midsummer.github.io/zh/posts/pastime/%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E9%9C%8D%E6%A0%BC%E6%B2%83%E8%8C%A8%E4%B9%8B%E9%81%97/</link>
